*  CONTROL, GREEN -- THE ONE-TOKEN TWIN of igt_computed_goto: identical signature, identical
*  body, and it leaves the procedure to a top-level label by a DIRECT `:(LADD)`.  Emitted as a
*  plain jmp: no new activation, no pushes, so the later :(RETURN) finds the procedure's own
*  {gamma,omega} pair.  This is the asm-diff partner -- diff its .s against the red's.
        DEFINE('f(OP)')                 :(fmain)
f                                       :(LADD)
LADD    OUTPUT = 'op=ADD'               :(RETURN)
fmain   f('ADD')
        OUTPUT = 'back'                 :(END)
END
